  TECHNICAL SPECS

    Platform       : Windows 10/11 (primary), Linux, macOS
    Executable     : hypersynapse.exe  (Windows)
                     hypersynapse      (Linux/macOS)
    Graphics API   : OpenGL 4.6 Core + Compute Shaders
    Language       : C++20 (MSVC 2022 / GCC 13 / Clang 17)
    Dependencies   : GLFW 3.4, GLM 1.0.1, GLAD 2.0.6, miniaudio 0.11.21
                     (all fetched at build time via CMake FetchContent)
    Resolution     : 1920 × 1080 @ 60 fps
    GPU Minimum    : NVIDIA RTX 3090 (45–55 fps)
    GPU Target     : NVIDIA RTX 5090 (60 fps locked)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  NARRATIVE ARC  (dystopian → surreal → transcendent)

    Act I   BOOT         0:00–0:45   Cold. Minimal. Something stirs.
    Act II  INFECTION    0:45–1:45   Loss of control. Reality fractures.
    Act III ASCENSION    1:45–3:00   Beautiful. Overwhelming. Organic.
    Act IV  TRANSCENDENCE 3:00–4:00  Cosmic. Emotional. Infinite.

  Seven scenes. One direction: outward.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  RENDERING TECHNIQUES

    ·  SDF raymarching with shared sdf_lib.glsl (scenes 2, 5, 6)
    ·  GPU particle system — compute shader physics, 32k–1M pool
    ·  Dual-layer Gaussian bloom (tight 0.4r + atmospheric 1.0r)
    ·  ACES tonemapping + per-act color grading
    ·  Barrel-distorted chromatic aberration (beat-reactive)
    ·  Lens flare with 5-ghost streak pattern (Acts II–III)
    ·  Procedural city with instanced geometry + displacement shaders
    ·  Recursive portal FBOs — nested universes at 3 depth levels
    ·  Holy-shit moment @ 2:50: camera pulls back to reveal universe
       as a single particle inside a larger universe
    ·  Gravitational lensing around universe-particle: chromatic Einstein
       ring arcs (1/r² point mass, 3-sample prismatic dispersion)
    ·  Beat-synchronized scene transitions at 133 BPM
    ·  CRT scanlines + film grain (Act I)
    ·  Temporal feedback abuse (Act II — Time Fracture)
    ·  Fractal raymarching: Mandelbox / SDF temples (Act III)

