  HOW TO RUN

    Windows (interactive):
      hypersynapse.exe

    Windows (capture WebM):
      hypersynapse.exe --capture
      ffmpeg -framerate 60 -i captures\frame_%06d.ppm ^
        -c:v libvpx-vp9 -b:v 10000k -pass 1 -f null NUL && ^
      ffmpeg -framerate 60 -i captures\frame_%06d.ppm ^
        -c:v libvpx-vp9 -b:v 10000k -pass 2 SINGULARITY_GARDEN.webm

    Linux/macOS (build):
      ./build.sh
      ./build/hypersynapse

    ESC or Q to exit early.

